      "text": "No disrespect\n\nI want to get my thoughts across\n\nYou can come back and berate me if wrong on the week\n\nHowever, I see why many will want to long 66 k dip because it has confluence on so many levels (MA traders, Monthly VAH , structure)\n\nPersonally think that given the incubation of this move and how $BTC tends to trade when it decides to push it will punish early bidders who have been convinced that getting in early is the play\n\nI think 64 k minimum target for week then let's assess\n\nId be very wary of premature bulls on feed calling for far higher in the near term\n\n#BTC",
