      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Timeless_Crypto/status/1848234941563191585",
      "text": "So what do I want to say constitutes bullish flip with the close in context:\n\nI want to see R-VOL pick up in a meaningful way (volume spot aggregated as we crack the 69-70 k region with force)\n\nI want to see premiums downtick on the up move with Coinbase ideally leading the charge and the rest of the cash markets playing accommodative roles\n\nLeverage ratios drop sharply as we move up (longs from lower taking aggressive profit, and fomo bears hitting red button hard - big delta prints as we grind higher)\n\nSpot bulls limit chasing the move and providing a floor to capture long liquidations on the way up\n\nThis is what it is like in a relentless bull market\n\nBulls can still do it, just dont see any meaningful change aside from (we are back at 70 k)",
